God, yes.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:40.630
So I was just thinking, since, you know, we
got Trump, of course, that got me thinking

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:50.080
that really I don't think that voting is so
much of a right as it is a privilege.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:58.710
So in that I would say I would just like to
ask you what the thoughts of sort of a maybe

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:03.050
like something like a citizenship test, but
not the citizenship test.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:09.570
But something just so that you're knowledgeable
and that you're informed about who and what

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.570
