00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.950
Yeah, whether that be lyssa quote.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:13.950
Right.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.740
I've taken versions of this question dozens
of times over the years.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:18.740
And I get the instinct.

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:19.740
I've taken it.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:23.540
Also, in terms of parenting, like, wouldn't
we be way better off if you had to pass some

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.430
